<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>No Recoil</Major>
    <Description>No recoil for APC that best works if you use it on hold key operation mode while holding no longer than 1.5 seconds.
It shoots really fast with almost no recoil which makes it usable with the +3 fire rate title along with +1 rapid fire recoil title.

1920x1080</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 10 ms
GoWhile 1 50
MoveR 0 30
GoWhile 6 11</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>